WEBVTT

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.490
Ninomiya, I want to ask you for a favor.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.910
Please, save this world.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:18.450
What...?

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.460
Th-That's the Demon Lord?

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.920
She looks just like Rim!

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:27.090
First of all, let me congratulate you
for making it all the way to my castle!

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.130
I am the Demon Lord.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:34.350
The ruler of the countless millions of
monsters that inhabit this barren land.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:41.060
The aura of my authority shall
forever be engraved into your souls...

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:26.750
Right!

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.340
Let's pretend we didn't see anything!

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.630
Agreed!

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:33.970
Hey, isn't that a bit coldhearted?

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.510
Sorry about that.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:41.350
Ever since my dear sister ripped it off,
it just doesn't stay in place.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.890
Wh-What in the world are you...?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.810
The Demon Lord that rules
over this world, of course.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:51.400
And why do you look just like Rim?

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.610
My dear sister, who's standing
right there, shared a womb with me.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.820
We're what humans call sisters.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.450
Sisters?

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.780
No idea.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.120
Then...

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.620
Perhaps this would remind you?

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.390
Impressive as always, dear sister.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:22.060
Y-You...

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:25.180
You're the Majin from back then!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.100
Finally, you recognize me.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:33.570
That "Majin" name was something you all
made up. I'm not particularly fond of it.

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:38.860
We are Guardians of the dungeons,
and by extension, this planet.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.780
Really?

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.870
No idea.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.040
Eons ago,

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:48.790
this planet was home to an advanced
civilization at the peak of splendor.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:52.630
They were called the Calonians.
They created "magic power"

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:57.470
and controlled not just this planet
but time and space as well.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:00.220
Ninomiya, you've experienced
their power before.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:05.470
They're the ones who sent you to this
world and also sent you to the future.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.350
What...?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:13.440
We Guardians are tasked with managing the
circulation of magic power in this world.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:18.820
In addition to that though, we are also
responsible for staying in our dungeons

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:23.120
to protect the treasures
buried there from humans.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.040
Huh? But...

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.830
Yes. The Detmolt dungeon
had a huge flaw...

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.290
The Guardian of that dungeon, Rim,

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.790
was really stupid.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.550
What?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.670
My dear sister forgot all about her duties
and spent her time on the surface.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:45.260
The circulation of magic power
within the dungeon was cut off.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:50.350
So the dungeon hastily
birthed a replacement: me.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.560
Enough with the extra details.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.570
I just have one question.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:59.900
Can you send me back to Japan, or not?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.200
The answer is "Yes."

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:06.700
But we're missing a few more key players
before we start that discussion.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.370
Hey, stop making excuses and...

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.000
Here they come.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.590
What?!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.010
It's Raiza'ha.

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.550
I thought Raiza'ha went out of business!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.350
They didn't. They just went into hiding.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.060
What do you mean?

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:35.230
After you got sent to this future,
Raiza'ha got in contact with the ruins.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:39.440
They discovered and studied
the Calonian technologies there.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.780
Spreading corporate drone culture
to the world to rule over it...

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.740
That much was fine.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:50.450
But they also did something that pushed
the world to the brink of collapse.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.710
Brink of collapse?

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:55.460
Yes. The mass consumption
of magic power using the ruins,

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:58.300
which brought ruination to the world.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.880
I don't care what happens to humans,

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:04.300
but consuming huge amounts of
magic power without circulating it,

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:07.470
that was a huge problem
I could not condone, as a Guardian.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:13.230
I had no choice but to go to
the surface and attack Raiza'ha.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:17.520
I was able to force them to retreat
into the rift between dimensions, but...

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.230
...it seems like that
won't last much longer.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:33.080
The final war for
this world will soon begin.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:39.170
If they win, this planet will become
a complete dystopia that requires no life.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.340
Their ultimate goal is to build a nation
composed entirely of corporate drones,

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.760
through the absolute
mechanization of the human race.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:47.680
That robot, it's from the other day...

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:52.350
Yes. That is their forward scout
tasked with brainwashing,

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.770
the "mechanized corporate soldier."

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:59.230
I didn't want this war.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:05.820
I have no intention of losing.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.030
However...

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.870
Now that Raiza'ha has the technology
and magic power of the Calonians,

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.580
they can return from
death almost infinitely,

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.250
coming back stronger each time.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:21.710
At the same time, they will continue
to shave life off this planet.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.840
Our future isn't too bright.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.510
That's why I brought you here.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:32.640
Please, go back in time
and stop Raiza'ha's evil deeds.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:36.640
I want you to alter history
and prevent this from happening.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:43.400
I thought this was supposed to be
a short talk, not such a heavy story.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.740
Why would you ask me, of all people?

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.490
Well...

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:53.200
Of all the people I know, you're
the worst at knowing when to give up.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.370
I understand this is
an unreasonable request.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.290
So...

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.460
The red door on the right
leads to a dimensional portal

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.510
that takes you to Japan.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:11.470
The blue door on the left leads to a time
portal that takes you back to the past.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.600
You get to choose
which door to go through.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.230
That's quite kind of you.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.640
What are you going to do, Ninomiya?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.400
Ever since I ended up in this world,

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.650
I've had to work at a crap company,

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.240
under completely worthless bosses,

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.570
wallowing in humiliation every day,

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.830
and when I finally
found the key to success,

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:36.750
I got whisked away into the future.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:41.000
Everything I built up was taken away.
I had to start from scratch.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:47.800
On top of that, those losers from Raiza'ha
are about to take over the world...

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.930
The absurdity of it
all makes my head spin.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.600
So then...

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.560
The answer is obvious.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.230
Ms. Shia! You have to rest!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.980
You've been working nonstop.
You'll collapse!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:12.030
I haven't met my quota yet.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:16.370
Until I do, nobody
will listen to my opinions.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:22.460
Being forced to take on an impossible
quota, with no freedom to even quit...

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:25.540
If we're unable to work,
we're quickly replaced.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:29.300
We're worse than slaves;
we're expendables.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.510
Look out, Ms. Shia!

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:43.060
My motivation to live
is generally quite petty.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:47.650
I can't stand seeing those
who look down on me get their way.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:52.400
It annoys me to see those
who tortured me rule the world.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.820
But...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:59.330
Those petty things are exactly
what I care about the most.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.710
I always strike back.

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:06.500
Hey, I'm back.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.550
Ninomiya...

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.010
Whoa, impressive...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.260
What are they all excited about?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.890
All the employees have
been pretty depressed,

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:25.690
including the Exploration Division.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:29.270
I guess seeing someone who's
been missing for a month come back

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:32.190
is a good enough story
to distract everyone.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.910
Mr. Kinji Ninomiya.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.830
Lady Belza has summoned you.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.370
That was fast.

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:48.840
I've been waiting for you, Ninomiya.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.210
You have been penalized for your extended
period away from work without permission,

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.550
breach of contract,
damage to company goods...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.760
The total amount is 10 million gold.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:04.390
In addition, we had to send a search party
after you, so you must pay for that, too.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.480
Hey!

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:09.110
I heard you're back, you rotten scum!

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:13.110
Your interest with us is stacking up, too!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.820
Fine, sure.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.870
This tiny debt;
I'll repay it in a quick swipe.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:22.830
Huh?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:25.750
It's all so simple for the new me.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:31.460
By the way, your company
dormitory was reassigned, too.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:38.890
There's no point in keeping a room open
for an employee who might be dead.

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.310
What's wrong with him?

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:51.400
Perhaps we should do something
before he goes out of control.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.690
Yes.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.400
Who is it...

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.910
I'm here!

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.030
All right, come in guys.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.280
Excuse me!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.330
So hungry.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:06.120
I'm so sorry, please excuse me...

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.830
What, what is this?! What's going on?!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.920
I don't have a place to live.
I'll be crashing here from today.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.050
Huh?

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.170
Huh?!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:19.300
What?!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:26.060
Listen, Mr. Ninomiya, this is only
until you find a new room, okay?!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:29.690
I'm only allowing this because it would
reflect badly on my "Hero" status

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:31.440
to not help an acquaintance in trouble.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:32.770
Do you understand?!

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.610
Sure, sure.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.400
More importantly, you have guests.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.820
Why don't you make some coffee or
something? Where are your manners?

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.740
Who are you to talk about manners?!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.580
No sugar, black coffee.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.660
Hey, Mr. Ninomiya?!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:50.540
Come on, don't be so mad. Oh, here.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.630
This is just a modest gift...

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:55.880
Oh, thank you for your kindness...

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:56.800
Um...

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:00.760
Who are you? What is your
relationship with Mr. Ninomiya?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.430
I've been wondering that, too.

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:06.180
Well, um...

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:12.270
Oh, right. You all aren't aware of
the path of glory I've been on lately.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:17.400
Then listen close! To my tale,
titled "Back to the Ninomiya"!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:25.780
So our civilization is doomed...?
I shouldn't have listened...

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:31.080
I'm surprised you all believe me.
Watch out for fraud and stuff, okay?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.290
And this girl is from the future...?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.250
Hi, I'm Ranga, a future person!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.800
I'm not buying any of this nonsense!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:42.680
Hold on, the important stuff starts here.

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.430
Yes, yes...

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:50.140
Oh no! It's so late already!
I need to head out immediately!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.770
Mr. Wanibe, I forgot
I'm organizing tonight's event!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.940
I have to prepare and leave right away.

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:55.480
What's going on?

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:59.690
There's a kickoff party, a joint event by
the Exploration and Gathering divisions.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:00.820
Free food?

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:01.780
Huh?

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.820
I said, is there free food?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:07.450
Yeah, actually.
Kind of rare for Raiza'ha, but...

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:11.160
Maybe we're about to get
assigned a big job soon?

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.420
Good. Rim, you have
five seconds to get ready.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:17.250
We're going to score us some free food.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.010
Ready!

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:24.300
Wait, Mr. Ninomiya!
Are you thinking of coming along?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.300
Is there a problem?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:31.270
Well... You've been gone
for a while, and...

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.230
Moreover, um...

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:35.730
People don't like you, Ninomiya.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:37.310
I'm fully aware of that!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:40.280
Look, I dislike uselessly fraternizing
with the common rabble!

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.240
Normally, I would have gladly
let you go on your way!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.280
Then why...

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:48.530
Because there's free food
and free booze to be had!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:53.080
Nothing in this world tastes better
than free food and free booze!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.210
So everyone,
please hold up your glasses...

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.210
Shoo! That's my food!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.300
What's that?

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.300
Hands off!

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.760
We haven't even said cheers yet...

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:04.550
Is he sitting in the
guest of honor's seat?

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:04.550
You...

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:08.180
Hey, Wanibe! Hand over
that thing of yours there!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.180
Hey, Ninomiya!

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:14.850
Anyway, everyone, cheers!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.480
Cheers!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:20.820
Hey, newbie! Show us what you got!

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:25.070
Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.620
I can't drink anymore...

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.530
You're killing the buzz!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.250
Stop ruining the party!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:38.330
You guys have been slacking off lately.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.750
R-Really?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:44.050
Yeah. You have no spirit,
as far as I can see!

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.470
You know what?

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:51.260
Kids these days are always saying,
"Oh, I don't want to get yelled at.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.180
I don't have a place to sleep." So weak!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:57.690
That's obviously what everyone has
to go through if you're working properly!

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:58.600
Right?!

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.270
--Huh.
--What?

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:08.030
Back in my day, we never even had the
chance to be so weak. Idiots, idiots...

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:08.030
Off he goes again.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:11.410
Wow, that's impressive, Mister Director!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:16.000
Let's see, what else.
Yes, this wine! It's too young.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.910
I had no idea!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.250
There's no history.
No history, I tell you.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.420
Wonderful!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:27.130
For a battle-hardened veteran like me,
there needs to be more depth, you know?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.300
You must be so strong!

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.180
That's so admirable!

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:32.930
Who is that girl? Does she work for us?

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:36.930
You can tell? My refined sensibilities?

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:36.930
I don't know,
but she's cute, so who cares?

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.310
Ouch... Shia, that idiot...

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.900
Hey, Ninomiya.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.400
You really never read the room, do you?

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:47.530
I'll read any room worth reading.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.820
You never change, do you?

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.740
And you're...

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:55.990
Hey! That look, you forgot who I am!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.830
It's Krutz!
From the ants incident, remember?!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:02.210
Oh, right, right, yeah.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:05.340
You really do have some crazy luck.

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:11.590
Everyone thought you were long dead.
Not that anybody would have missed you.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.550
Not that I would care.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.260
But still, you gave us courage.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:20.060
I think a lot of people were
relieved to hear you made it back.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.650
What does that mean?

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.690
What does that mean? Well, obviously...

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.650
Mr. Ninomiya.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.650
Are you sure about this?

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.280
She's eating quite a lot.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:32.410
I thought the company's paying tonight.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:37.200
What are you talking about?
She and Ranga aren't our employees.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.870
The company won't pay for them, obviously.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.620
And neither would I, of course.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.840
No. No problem. None at all!

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:52.930
I have the ultimate plan. I will no longer
be affected by these petty details!

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.760
Booze!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:01.060
Bring me all the booze you've got!

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.520
How irresponsible!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:10.690
You drank without thinking at all and
now you're too hung over for work?!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.240
What a shame!

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:16.120
Stop yelling, my head hurts...

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:19.950
Perhaps you should think about how
your actions affect the immediate future

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.000
before worrying about changing
the future 300 years from now!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.710
Look at Ranga!

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.250
What about Ranga?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.880
Are you going somewhere?

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:32.170
Yeah, the Director
introduced me to a good job.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.220
I have an interview.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.850
I have to pay Ms. Shia our living
expenses. I'll work real hard!

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.310
What a wonderful person...

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:46.650
I'm not putting up with this. I have
to go to work as soon as I'm ready.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.650
Ranga, take care!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:51.360
Yes, I'm off!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.490
Rim, do you want to come along?

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:54.990
Hmm...

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:01.750
So this is what the world
300 years ago is like.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.250
I have Shia's allowance. Should we buy it?

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.970
So super cute!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.430
You look good, Rim!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.680
What about you?

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:24.680
Yeah. I heard that, if I get the job,
the workplace has lots of outfits!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:26.480
So I don't need this!

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:35.110
Oh, look Rim!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.950
That cloud looks like a steak!

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.700
Meat...

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.200
Oh, too bad. It broke up.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.120
The sky is pretty.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.210
This is fun.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.300
Yes.

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:55.010
Oh, that's the place!

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.260
I'm off, see ya!

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:00.220
Sky...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.140
I'm sorry to inconvenience you as well...

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:08.810
Isn't this too salty? I don't dislike it,
but be more careful next time.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:09.810
What?!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:10.940
I'm home!

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.730
I totally got the job!

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:17.240
Looking cute and talking to customers?
What a dream job!

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.950
I went ahead and jumped
into work right away!

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.620
They pay every day, too!

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:24.870
Here, Ms. Shia!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.750
Ranga...

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.370
Burp.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.920
Oh, Rim, you just got back, too?

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.000
Rim, what's that outfit?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.460
I've never seen that before...

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.460
There we go.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.760
Wow, your stomach!

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:38.170
Did you eat random garbage again?!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.800
No, she didn't, Ninomiya.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.640
Hmm?

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.390
Not random garbage.

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:48.520
Rim actually showed up to the dormitory
today and ate all the stocked-up food.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.770
Huh?

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:56.150
So full. Can't move.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:53.770
They said they'll
subtract it from your pay.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.150
Sorry, I forgot to let you know.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:21:00.740
What are you going to do, Ninomiya?
Your debts are piling up.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:09.330
Forget about the debts!
I have a secret plan.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.920
You said that the other day, too.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:15.250
Remember the story
about the future I told you?

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:18.550
The world is going to
get taken over by Raiza'ha,

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:21.970
because of the ruins
beneath the dungeon, right?

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:27.270
About that. Don't you think
I would be able to do much better?

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:29.770
Behold, my party members!

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.480
You're all lacking
in the brains department,

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:35.110
but you're quite formidable
in terms of brawn.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:38.780
Under my guidance, we'll overtake Belza
and reach the ruins in no time!

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:40.280
And then!

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:42.740
With superior science
and ultimate firepower,

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:44.570
I'll achieve total world domination!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.990
Nation building, by me, for me!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:53.500
I will establish the ultimate
ideal immortal dystopia!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:59.710
Yes! Today I begin my ultimate plan,
"Operation: Eternal Capital"!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.550
Great, Ninomiya!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:05.800
Ninomiya, I hate
to break this to you, but...

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:10.060
Right now, the dungeons,
starting from the third floor and below,

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:13.980
are much tougher than they used to be.

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:16.770
Seriously?
